151	  // SHA-256 (FIPS 180-4) of an ASCII string, as hex. It is only ever fed the
152	  // 32-character share id. `crypto.subtle` would do the same, but it does not
153	  // exist on a plain-http page that is not localhost — which a share on a LAN
